	<section_number>29.1-309</section_number>
	<catch_line>Fees to trap</catch_line>
	<text>
		The license fee to trap shall be as follows or as such fee may be subsequently revised by the Board pursuant to § 29.1-103:
		<section prefix="1">County or city resident license, ten dollars.
		</section>
		<section prefix="2">State resident license, thirty-five dollars.
		</section>
		<section prefix="3">State nonresident license, $150.
		</section>
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 29-56; 1952, c. 608; 1974, c. 363; 1979, c. 287; 1980, c. 494; 1983, c. 191; 1987, c. 488; 1988, c. 250; 1995, c. 77; 2009, c. 9.</history>
